{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-03-16 05:00:00', 'title': 'SPANISH BROADCASTING SYSTEM SIGNS MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT WITH NIELSEN AUDIO', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, NIELSEN (NYSE: NLSN) ANNOUNCED THAT SPANISH BROADCASTING SYSTEM (SBS) HAS ENTERED INTO A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT FOR NIELSEN AUDIO SERVICES. THIS MULTI-YEAR RENEWAL INCLUDES A CONTINUATION OF THEIR AUDIO AUDIENCE MEASUREMENT LICENSES ACROSS ALL FIVE PPM MARKETS AND THE DIARY MARKET OF PUERTO RICO.'}